      496.45,
      549.7,
      589.79
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 33 of the Antiquities Ordinance (Chapter 188), I, Delath Thusitha Mendis, Director General of Archaeology, do by this noti\ufb01cation declare with the approval of the Land Commissioner, that the area of the state land speci\ufb01ed in the Schedule, to this Noti\ufb01cation shall be an \u201cArchaeological Reserve\u201d for the purposes of the aforesaid Ordinance. DELATH THUSITHA MENDIS, Director General of Archaeology.Colombo,08th July, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
